## ADD missing FUNCTIONS rules - see LL1-v10
## ADD missing STRINGS rules - see LL1-v10
## ADD missing TEMPLATES rules - see LL1-v10  ## ADD missing template specialization
## ADD parallel programming (NEW)
## ADD missing ATOMS rules - see LL1-v10  ## CHK correction of LL1 rules
## ADD missing MISC rules - see LL1-v10  ## CHK correction of LL1 rules
## ADD missing SCALARS rules - see LL1-v10  ## CHK correction of LL1 rules
